# TextFSM template for `show mac-address-table` on Cisco Catalyst 2950 EI.
# The MAC value pattern (hhhh.hhhh.hhhh) skips the header and dashed separator.
# VLAN may be "All" for STATIC control-plane/CPU entries; PORTS may be "CPU".
# Verified: IOS 12.1(22)EA9, WS-C2950G-48-EI.
Value VLAN (\S+)
Value MAC ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value PORTS (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${VLAN}\s+${MAC}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PORTS}\s*$$ -> Record
